{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>When one sins unintentionally.</b> He brings [an offering] for unintentional [sin], and he does not bring for intentional [sin]." "<b>From any one of them.</b> The first mem is superfluous, and the second one brings the first. Examples: כעם ככהן, כמוני כמוך, כשפחה כגבירתה, כעמי כעמך, כחשכה כאורה."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:56.947829986Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}